### Issue Analysis: Binary Data Encoding Failure

#### Problem Description:
When sending a PUT request with a binary payload using the `requests` library, the request fails due to the `to_native_string` function being called on the binary data. This issue was introduced in version 2.9 of the `requests` library.

#### Example Code:
```python
import requests
requests.put("http://httpbin.org/put", data=u"ööö".encode("utf-8"))
```

